      "text": "° For example :\n    - you might set up a Detector to flag for possible\n      prompt injection\n\n    - this Detector will then detect the Input text \n      as possible prompt injection\n      and\n      prevent it from being sent to the Model",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° For example :\n    - you might set up a Detector to flag for possible\n      prompt injection\n\n    - this Detector will then detect the Input text \n      as possible prompt injection\n      and\n      prevent it from being sent to the Model",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
